<title>LITHUANIA: MEDICINOS POSTS 7 MO 401,000 LITAS NET PROFIT.</title>
<headline>MEDICINOS POSTS 7 MO 401,000 LITAS NET PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The first seven months of 1997</p>
<p>( all amounts in million of litas unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		   401,000  vs losses 2.43</p>
<p>    Assets			 56.777   vs 47.797</p>
<p>    Loan portfolio	     39.8     vs 29.94</p>
<p>    Deposits		     40.62    vs 35.03</p>
<p>Notes: The figures of assets, loan portfolio and deposits</p>
<p>are compared to the beginning of 1997.</p>
<p>The bank posted a 346,000 litas net profit for the first</p>
<p>half of 1997.</p>
<p>The current share capital of the bank is 23.147 million</p>
<p>litas and the shareholders of the bank decided in July to boost</p>
<p>it by 3 million litas.</p>
<p>-- Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
